  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>42</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>56</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>72</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now using the property of adjoint of matrix we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is order of square matrix,</p><p>Now using the above two formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
